  <h3>各题型分值</h3>
  <div class="tw">
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:34%">题型</th><th style="width:16%">题数</th><th style="width:20%">每题分值</th><th>小计</th></tr>
    <tr><td>听力篇章（六级为讲座与讲话）</td><td>10</td><td><b>14.2</b></td><td>142</td></tr>
